            "description": "Run this SQL query in MySQL client to verify seats were created:\nSELECT seat_number, is_reserved, showtime_id FROM seats WHERE showtime_id = 1 ORDER BY seat_number LIMIT 20;\n\nExpected output:\nA1  | false | 1\nA2  | false | 1\nA3  | false | 1\n...\nA15 | false | 1\nB1  | false | 1\n...\n\nTo count all seats:\nSELECT COUNT(*) FROM seats WHERE showtime_id = 1;\nShould return 150 for a 10x15 matrix."
